					<div class="box-text">
						<p>&nbsp;<span style="font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: large;">The</span><span style="font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: large;">&nbsp;</span><strong style="font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: large;">Prospectus</strong><span style="font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: large;">&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: large;">is the document containing all the &nbsp;corporate, legal and financial information related to the Company and the securities to be listed, which must be disclosed prior to the public offering.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-size: large;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;">This is an essential document for the listing of securities, and it is essential to this process, as it will be the document that the Greater Investing Public will have to help them make a decision and purchase the securities covered by the Public Offer.&nbsp;</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p><span style="font-size: large;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p><span style="font-size: large;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;">&nbsp;To see the final prospectus select&nbsp;<strong>MARKET</strong>&nbsp;and</span><strong><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;">&nbsp;ASSET CLASS.</span></strong></span></p>










